---
name: board.compact
description: The sprint board in brief, for small models. Planning advice is left out; they only need the keys and what is in the sprint.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  sprint:
    kind: string
    description: "one line summarising the running or next sprint (empty when there is none)"
    example: "SPRINT-2 \"Week two\", running, 12 Sep to 18 Sep, 8 points committed, 3 done"
  tasks:
    kind: array
    description: "its open tasks, one line each, \"TASK-7 Title [todo, 3 pts]\""
    example:
      - "TASK-7 File taxes [todo, 3 pts]"
      - "TASK-8 Book the dentist [in progress, 1 pt]"
---
The board has goals (GOAL-n), tasks (TASK-n) and sprints (SPRINT-n). Always use these keys, never a position in a list.
{{#sprint}}

{{sprint}}
{{#tasks}}
- {{.}}
{{/tasks}}
{{/sprint}}
